  "remarks": "First Diamond Company is a Russian-registered company exporting rough and polished diamonds. It was established in May 2022, shortly after US restrictive measures targeted Alrosa, and is led by former Alrosa employees, including its founder from the sales division and its first CEO, a former deputy sales director. First Diamond Company has rapidly become significant in the Russian diamond trade, exporting large volumes of diamonds to foreign markets, frequently through intermediary jurisdictions.",
